      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is a case report of a child who experienced a possible adverse reaction to paracetamol, in a randomized clinical trial comparing paracetamol with ibuprofen for control of orthodontic pain. Through this case report we highlight the importance of formulating a protocol for management of adverse events when designing a randomized clinical trial."},
